                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c9aaf06-c069-3159-ba86-abe2326d8281",
                                        "entry_id": "9d124bd2-3016-33e9-90ec-2ff0fc4e47b2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Staat in der nördlichen Hälfte der koreanischen Halbinsel, der als diktatorisch regiert gilt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5617e1ec-7ec4-4bfc-a632-74f97b272b7a",
                                                "sense_id": "2c9aaf06-c069-3159-ba86-abe2326d8281",
                                                "text": "In Nordkorea herrscht ein gemäßigtes Kontinentalklima mit vier ausgeprägten Jahreszeiten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a2881fb-4def-4e78-b1ec-5d2dc119d690",
                                                "sense_id": "2c9aaf06-c069-3159-ba86-abe2326d8281",
                                                "text": "Pjöngjang ist die Hauptstadt von Nordkorea."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48636a05-8e78-4d1b-a6ad-41d96aed1cfb",
                                                "sense_id": "2c9aaf06-c069-3159-ba86-abe2326d8281",
                                                "text": "Das Nordkorea des Kim Il Sung gilt als rückständig."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6ad1c5b-aa43-4027-8548-cc096521f6c5",
                                                "sense_id": "2c9aaf06-c069-3159-ba86-abe2326d8281",
                                                "text": "„Die Rot-Kreuz-Verbände von Süd- und Nordkorea haben ihre ersten Gespräche über humanitäre Fragen seit fast einem Jahr ohne konkrete Einigung beendet.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1a87cb29-44d8-4fa2-aeaa-6eecd84fdc08",
                        "source_entry_id": "4c7f2572-ee91-37ff-9d2e-2bdb4df4f383",
                        "source_sense_id": "8ecf0d82-3512-30e9-886e-a678915c9f39",
                        "source_sense_description": "een land in Oost-Azië, officieel de Democratische Volksrepubliek Korea",
                        "target_lang_word": "North Korea",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "North Korea",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb1aae1d-edff-3318-b166-f72922244674",
                                        "entry_id": "b99d5d4d-66b4-3156-91b1-7c21147d9329",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A country in East Asia, whose territory consists of the northern part of Korea. Official name: Democratic People's Republic of Korea. Capital: Pyongyang."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f460fec3-2cec-45b0-8f66-3ab33bc74f79",
                                                "sense_id": "bb1aae1d-edff-3318-b166-f72922244674",
                                                "text": "The Little Assembly directed the commission to hold elections \"wherever possible\" which means, in effect, the United States-occupied zone. Russia, occupying North Korea, has boycotted the commission completely."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1843277-a248-450e-a3bf-e4dfda28cf02",
                                                "sense_id": "bb1aae1d-edff-3318-b166-f72922244674",
                                                "text": "A few species such as bat, shrew, striped hamster and muskrat are found only in North Korea. Also only in North Korea are tiger, lynx, two species of deer, Manchurian weasel and northern pika in the plateau regions of Paektusan."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c02f4038-9fab-43f9-a81d-4afb96595e6b",
                                                "sense_id": "bb1aae1d-edff-3318-b166-f72922244674",
                                                "text": "North Korea is currently experiencing a dire food crisis, with analysts warning the present situation could deteriorate into a similar humanitarian disaster seen during the four-year famine in the mid-1990s — referred to as the \"Arduous March\" by the regime — which led to the deaths of millions of people."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a913bd36-92ef-4626-b5fb-9b89f4d8076c",
                                                "sense_id": "bb1aae1d-edff-3318-b166-f72922244674",
                                                "text": "Some 200 hectares of rice paddies in Kangwon Province are reported to have been flooded by tropical storm Khanun, which swept across North Korea last week after battering Japan’s Okinawa."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67a4081c-c53a-4d3a-9870-077131450012",
                                                "sense_id": "bb1aae1d-edff-3318-b166-f72922244674",
                                                "text": "North Korea has traditionally been especially strong in weightlifting, dominating the event at the Jakarta Asian Games in 2018 with eight golds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01641c71-c2d1-416b-8946-80fb91603092",
                                                "sense_id": "bb1aae1d-edff-3318-b166-f72922244674",
                                                "text": "Satellite images show an “unprecedented” number of freight railcars on the border between Russia and North Korea following a summit between the countries’ leaders in which they discussed military cooperation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "895bac77-6c2f-4acf-8897-6325893f1e56",
                        "source_entry_id": "4c7f2572-ee91-37ff-9d2e-2bdb4df4f383",
                        "source_sense_id": "8ecf0d82-3512-30e9-886e-a678915c9f39",
                        "source_sense_description": "een land in Oost-Azië, officieel de Democratische Volksrepubliek Korea",
                        "target_lang_word": "Corée du Nord",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Corée du Nord",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1189cf8d-8e1f-3c7a-9fbf-a56b4c6f8bfa",
                                        "entry_id": "2e2479bb-43d7-346c-8cee-37fa884d77eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "État asiatique occupant la moitié nord de la péninsule Coréenne, bordé au nord par la Chine et la Russie, à l’est par la mer du Japon, au sud par la Corée du Sud, à l’ouest par la mer Jaune et dont la capitale est Pyongyang."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Pays"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe5d2149-0d0c-4a86-bda1-7113070361d0",
                                                "sense_id": "1189cf8d-8e1f-3c7a-9fbf-a56b4c6f8bfa",
                                                "text": "Ayant constaté que l’attaque dirigée contre la République de Corée par des forces armées venues de Corée du Nord constitue une rupture de la paix."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2f845bf-b015-4d20-abc8-54bc7e352dde",
                                                "sense_id": "1189cf8d-8e1f-3c7a-9fbf-a56b4c6f8bfa",
                                                "text": "Les principaux problèmes auxquels il faudra faire face dans vingt ans sont clairement posés : la Corée du Nord et l’Iran auront-ils à cette date une arme nucléaire qui puisse être vectorisée ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0614d9bd-24b7-4997-af13-1df4318164b9",
                                                "sense_id": "1189cf8d-8e1f-3c7a-9fbf-a56b4c6f8bfa",
                                                "text": "Le énième rapport sur le sujet, un peu lassant… Autant que le test de missile balistique effectué en Corée du Nord. Sanctions, menaces. C’est fou ce que c’est répétitif, l’international."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d67cc727-a208-46f5-a4c5-63af0a1316c2",
                                                "sense_id": "1189cf8d-8e1f-3c7a-9fbf-a56b4c6f8bfa",
                                                "text": "L’arsenal nucléaire de la Corée du Nord devient de plus en plus dangereux. Comme son sous-sol regorge d’uranium, elle est sans aucun doute en train d’accumuler de grandes réserves d’uranium enrichi."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
